<title>CANADA: Contrans Corp Q2 net profits rise.</title>
<headline>Contrans Corp Q2 net profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended Feb 28.</p>
<p>				1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.34		   C$0.22</p>
<p> Net			  1,416			932</p>
<p> Revs			20,366		   20,943</p>
<p>	    6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.63		   C$0.45</p>
<p> Net			  2,767		    2,145</p>
<p> Revs			43,677		   41,820</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q2 earnings include C$463,000 (C$0.11 per share) extraordinary gain.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
